  "details": "Currently the Age Verification button is not easy to access, in the client it doesn't show you a prompt to do it in the VRC+ menu or profile or settings anywhere, and on the website there is no obvious way to verify yourself.\n\nThe link is buried in a blog post, which leads to poor discoverability for people who would like to verify their age.\n\nPlease make it the client and website show a prompt to verify the user's age on the profile / VRC+ section, and when there is an instance that requires age verification.",
